sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as Backend API
    participant AUTH as Auth Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant CACHE as Redis (refresh token store)

    U->>FE: Submit email + password
    FE->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    API->>AUTH: authenticate(email, password)
    AUTH->>DB: SELECT user WHERE email=...
    DB-->>AUTH: user row (hashed password)
    AUTH->>AUTH: verify_hash(password, stored_hash)
    alt invalid credentials
        AUTH-->>API: AuthenticationError
        API-->>FE: 401 { error: "invalid email or password" }
        FE-->>U: Show generic error (no user enumeration)
    else valid credentials
        AUTH->>AUTH: generate JWT access token (short TTL)
        AUTH->>AUTH: generate refresh token (long TTL)
        AUTH->>CACHE: store refresh token (userId, tokenId)
        AUTH-->>API: {access_token, refresh_token}
        API-->>FE: 200 {access_token, refresh_token, role}
        FE->>FE: store tokens (memory / secure storage)
        FE-->>U: Redirect to Home
    end

    Note over FE,API: Later — access token expires
    FE->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/refresh (refresh_token)
    API->>AUTH: rotate(refresh_token)
    AUTH->>CACHE: validate token exists & not revoked
    alt token invalid/revoked
        AUTH-->>API: Unauthorized
        API-->>FE: 401 → force re-login
    else token valid
        AUTH->>CACHE: revoke old token, store new token (rotation)
        AUTH-->>API: new {access_token, refresh_token}
        API-->>FE: 200 new tokens
    end
